-- The reclaim ponds will be monitored for the condition of wildlife exclusion features and the presence of mortalities as required for the Nevada Department of Wildlife’s (NDOW) Industrial Artificial Pond Permit. Mortalities will be reported on a quarterly basis according to NDOW’s standard reporting forms. For certain species (i.e., migratory birds, game species, sensitive and threatened/endangered species) and mortalities associated with toxic solutions, telephone notification of mortalities to NDOW is required within 24 hours of discovery.
